        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Impressive two-bedroom house in Pouladuff, Co. Cork, presented in excellent order throughout and offering a comfortable layout with well-balanced living accommodation. The property benefits from two bathrooms, including an en-suite, and is further enhanced by practical features such as parking, an alarm system and heated flooring, combining everyday convenience with a welcoming sense of warmth and security.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is complemented by a conservatory, which adds a bright and versatile living space, while the garden, patio and balcony provide a pleasant selection of outdoor areas to enjoy. These features create an attractive setting for both relaxing and entertaining, with the home enjoying a thoughtful arrangement that makes the most of its internal and external spaces.\r\n\r\nResidents also benefit from access to a concierge service and tennis court, adding to the overall appeal of the property and the lifestyle on offer. With its combination of sought-after features and a convenient location in Pouladuff, this house will appeal to a wide range of purchasers seeking a well-appointed home in Cork."
